# Build output. NEVER commit this. The SWA workflow runs `npm run build` and then
# uploads dist/ verbatim (skip_app_build: true), so a committed dist/ is only ever
# consulted when something skips the build — and the stale copy that lived here
# was a MOCK build pointed at a decommissioned Render backend. Shipping it looks
# perfectly healthy and talks to no backend at all.
dist/
